      "id": "lock",
      "text": "[V] / [R3]  LOCK-ON the nearest enemy  ·  tap again to switch target (or flick the right stick)  ·  hold to release"
    },
    {
      "rect": [
        4,
        36,
        3,
        5
      ],
      "id": "switch",
      "text": "LIGHT SWITCH: kill the lights. Unaware guards are blind in the dark — but someone may walk over to turn them back on."
    },
    {
      "rect": [
        1,
        27,
        3,
        6
      ],
      "id": "dog",
      "text": "A DOG. It smells you if you rush past. SNEAK, or take it down from behind. Dogs bark for their owners."
